                    DIGITAL EQUIPMENT CORPORATION
                 ESTABLISHES NEW VEER AWARD PROGRAM


       Innovative Program Awards Further Incentive to Storage
              Solutions Partners and Storage Resellers



MAYNARD, Mass., December 20, 1995 -- Digital Equipment Corporation
today announced "The PERFECT FIT Program," an innovative awards 
promotion that provides value-added storage resellers in Europe and 
North America with additional incentive to sell the popular
StorageWorks product line.  Perfect Fit is the newest of a host of 
VEER programs Digital has developed to ensure its resellers are 
uniquely compensated for meeting increasing customer demand for 
Digital's storage products.

     With a unique two-tiered approach, Perfect Fit offers both an 
immediate cash award for product sales, as well as a point program 
that results in additional cash rewards ranging from $500 to 
$20,000, depending on the level of sales achieved over a nine month 
period (1-OCT-95 through 28-JUN-96).  The program rewards sales 
representatives and their managers for selling a range of Digital's 
StorageWorks multivendor products, including its award-winning 
family of StorageWorks RAID Array subsystems, which are in 
increasing demand among corporations seeking fast and reliable data 
access, as well as controllers, 4mm, 8mm and especially DLT tape
drives/loaders, and enclosures.

     "Digital recognizes that the RAID market is burgeoning, with 
analysts predicting that it will increase to ten billion dollars by 
1998," stated Ron Burnett, worldwide channel programs manager for 
the Storage Business Unit.  "This market trend represents 
significant revenue opportunities for our VEER partners, with 
opportunity for follow-on sales as well.  Now, with the Perfect Fit 
program, we are providing further incentive for VARs to offer 
end-users our StorageWorks solutions -- the industry's most robust, 
highest-performing RAID subsystems available that support open,
multivendor architectures and environments."

     For more information about the new "Perfect Fit" incentive 
program, the StorageWorks Reseller Program or the StorageWorks 
Solution Partners Program, VARs can call Digital:  

     North America Phone (Toll-Free): 1-800-STORWORK (786-7967)
     Fax:  508-841-5841
     Internet mail:  1800storwork@shr.mts.dec.com
     Europe  Phone:  31-24-352.9985
     Fax:  31-24-352.9965
     Internet mail:  storageworks@stowks.enet.dec.com

     The StorageWorks product line is a comprehensive family of 
disk, tape and optical storage subsystems, offering modular, 
competitively-priced, industry-standard solutions in customizable 
desktop, deskside, departmental and datacenter enclosures.  
StorageWorks products are available on multiple operating systems 
and hardware platforms, including Digital, Hewlett-Packard, IBM and 
Sun workstations and servers, and Novell and Windows NT 
environments.

